 "remarks": "Welcome to this Wilton border luxury end-unit. Move in ready with nearly 2,000 sq. ft. of beautifully maintained living space, the perfect home alternative. Soaring vaulted ceilings, skylights and oversized windows fill the interior with natural light. A rear 40-foot deck-creates private outdoor living and entertaining space, perfect for grilling and gardening. Enjoy the updated kitchen with breakfast bar, pantry and large dining room with hardwood floors. Relax in your vaulted and sun-filled living room with built in bookcases. Retire upstairs to your primary bedroom with walk-in-closet, a second spacious bedroom and a fabulous open loft overlooking the living area-perfect for a home office, sitting room or creative space. Baths are updated and closets are customized. Laundry and storage is located on the first floor. Additional and private basement storage complete the home. Step downstairs and enjoy a distinctly urban, New York-style vibe with local favorites including Letizia's Pizza, Michele's Pies and incredible Korean cuisine right outside your door. Generous parking for owners and guests. In the heart of shopping, dining and breweries, with quick access to Route 7, I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. A One-of-a-Kind home alternative!",
